# .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml); neither is committed. dashboard/v26/
# and docs/ (both retired 2026-09-07 in favor of this single build path) are
# listed here too in case older local checkouts still have them on disk.
_site/
dashboard/v26/
docs/
node_modules/

